Description: Honor scanout row pitch in the Slint software renderer
 Rows can contain padding beyond the visible width. Derive the pixel stride
 from the mapped buffer to prevent corrupted rendering.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/slint-ui/slint/commit/234908a5ee1991ebbd30743c40e8673515ae8150
Author: retro98boy <retro98boy@qq.com>

